          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "V'aizilaeli ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa mbele lwa mwezi gwa wu'datu' ku'fuma aho V'aizilaeli ndi' v'awu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili, lu'siku' lwenu'lo hu' ndi' v'afika ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma ku' Lefidimu, v'ingi'laga ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai na kwenu'ko v'atu'u'laga nkambi' ha mbele ya lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose waliinaga ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu', ki'gele akapome na Mulungu. Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lo na ku'muwi'la, “I'vi hu' vyene u'ku'v'awi'la v'av'yalwa v'amwa Yakobo, av'o V'aizilaeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Inywe v'eni'ki'li' mwawonile i'vi nav'av'ezezizye V'amisili, na i'vi namusolile inywe ki'ti' nyanda i'vyo yi'li'wu'syaga v'ana v'ayo mu manana gayo, na ku'muleta ku' wanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' u'lu' mugu'degeleke muzwi gwanne ku' lu'doono, na ku'li'dima ilagano lyanne, haho inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'anne v'asogolwa mugati' na makabi'la gose, ninga i'vi welelo yose yi'li' nsawo yanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe mulav'e ku' wanne wu'temi wa v'ahozya na nsi' nsondo. Zyeni'zyo hu' mihayo i'zyo u'ku'v'awi'la V'aizilaeli.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wasu'v'aga na wav'itanaga v'anamala v'a Izilaeli na ku'v'awi'la mihayo zyose i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga av'awi'le. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'antu' v'ose v'asu'v'yaga ku' haki'mo ati', “Ku'ku'v'ezya magambo gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga.” Haho Mose wasu'v'yaga mihayo zyav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ene nku'v'a nu'wiza mugati' na ilunde itimbu, ki'gele v'antu' v'enav'a v'av'e v'ali'wigwa i'vyo nu'yomba nanho, nav'o v'aku'ku'sani'zya mu nsiku' zyav'o zyose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu mihayo zya v'antu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Yaga u'kav'asondohye v'antu' v'enav'a walelo na igolo. U'v'awi'le v'avikanze vizwalo vyav'o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ku'fiki'i'la lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' v'av'e v'igelani'zyaga, ku'nguno lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndasooke ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ha mbele ya minso ga v'antu' v'ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanho u'v'atu'u'li'le v'antu' lu'v'i'mbi' ku' ki'la lwandi' ku'pilima lu'gu'lu'. U'ku'v'agizya v'iangali'le v'aleke ku'liina lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lu' ninga ku'lu'kuumya. U'yo alalu'kuumye lu'gu'lu' nhanayene alawu'lagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize amukuumye muntu' mwenu'yo, ali'vi alagu'mwe na mawe, ninga ku'laswa na masonga. Av'e muntu' ninga ndimu, akasye azuwu'ke. Sumbwa itungo i'lo milangale zilali'le kayawaya, haho v'antu' v'ose v'alegele ha lu'gu'lu'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wasookaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu', na wav'ayi'laga v'antu' na ku'v'asondohya. Haho nav'o v'avikanzaga vizwalo vyav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'awi'laga ati', “Mwiv'ange ku' lu'siku' lwa wu'datu'. Ki'la mugosya ku'du' amwegele muki'ma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga mu lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', itungo lya ndiyu', hav'age na ngilimo, wu'meku'le wa nku'v'a, haki'mo na ilunde itimbu ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu', na muzwi gwa milangale gwali'laga kayawaya. Haho v'antu' v'ose av'o v'av'age ha nkambi' v'atetemaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wav'alondolaga v'antu' ku'fuma ha nkambi', ki'gele v'aye v'akiwone na Mulungu. V'ose v'ayaga ku'ki'i'ma ha nsi'li'li' ya lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalo lu'gu'lu' lose lwa Sinai lwakumbi'lagwa na lyonsi, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' ali'sooka ha igu'lya nalo mugati' na moto. Nalyo lyonsi lya moto gwenu'go gwaliinaga ku' igu'lya ki'ti' lyonsi lya itanuli ihanya, na lu'gu'lu' lose lwatetemaga ku' nguzu muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo muzwi gwa milangale gwaku'laga muno. Hangi' Mose wayombaga na Mulungu, Mulungu nawe wasu'v'yaga ku' muzwi gwa ngilimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga ha igu'lya na nsoto na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. Haho wamwitanaga Mose aliine kwenu'ko ku' nsoto na lu'gu'lu'. Hohene Mose waliinaga ku' igu'lya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Sooka ha nsi'li'li' u'kav'ahane v'antu' v'ose ku'du' v'asyepe ku'no ku'ndola ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. U'lu' v'av'ezye vyeni'vyo v'ingi mugati' nav'o v'aku'fwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga v'ahozya av'o v'ali'v'a v'ali'negela yi'li'v'adima v'isondohye, ki'gele ndeke ku'v'apa lu'duko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose nawe wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ati', “V'antu' v'enav'a v'akakowola ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, ku'nguno ev'e mweni'ki'li' waku'gizizye na ku'yomba, ‘Tu'u'li lu'v'i'mbi' mu ngiligili na lu'gu'lu' na ku'lu'leka lu'sondo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Sooka ha nsi'li'li' u'kamulete Aloni ize haki'mo nanho. Ali'vi v'ahozya haki'mo na v'antu' v'angi' ku'du' v'asyepe ku'negela ene, ki'gele ndeke ku'v'apa lu'duko.” ",
          "type": "text",
